              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sipadzakhala otsala ndi mmodzi yemwe, chifukwa ndidzalanga anthu a ku Anatoti chikadzafika chaka chawo cha chilango.' \"",
          "type": "text",
